      </section>
      <p class="cross-link">Sharing a listener story or sip idea? Use our <a href="/spill-it-bestie/">Spill it</a>, <a href="/healing-inbox/">Healing</a>, or <a href="/suggestasip/">Suggest a Sip</a> inboxes instead.</p>
    </div>`;
}

